`fetchBodyByUid` 用 `imap.fetch([parseInt(uid)])` 按 UID fetch，逻辑正确。

问题可能是这些邮件是**今天刚同步进来的重复邮件**，uid 可能是 0 或者无效值。查一下：

```bash
docker exec iMail node -e "
const db=require('better-sqlite3')('/app/data/imall.db');
const rows=db.prepare(\"SELECT uid,folder,subject,body,raw_date FROM emails WHERE account_id IN (SELECT id FROM accounts WHERE email='824559662@qq.com') AND body='' ORDER BY raw_date DESC LIMIT 5\").all();
rows.forEach(r=>console.log('uid:',r.uid,'folder:',r.folder,'subject:',r.subject.slice(0,20)));
"
```

uid 有效，folder 是 inbox。问题是这些邮件 raw_date 在近3月范围内但 body 为空，说明 SEARCH SINCE 拉到了这些邮件但 body 没有成功写入。

看 `/body` 接口是否正常工作，直接测试一封：

```bash
docker exec iMail node -e "
const {fetchBodyByUid}=require('./src/imap');
const db=require('better-sqlite3')('/app/data/imall.db');
